      "side": 1,
      "message": "I have moved this into into `dexpreoptToolDepsMutator` and turned line 219 into a `||`\n\nAfter I did this, I also realized that previously `dex2oatd` was not getting added as a dep to the source apex as I initially thought because it does not embed the `dexpreopter` struct and does not implement `DexpreopterInterface`. This is a superflous dep for source apex, so I think it should be fine either for way for now.\n\n\u003e Also, I wonder if you can move the mutator to a location that is common to dexpreopt, instead of keeping it in java/java.go, to make it more discoverable. I\n\nI think this is a good idea. I would like to create a single final deps mutator that will be responsible for adding dex2oat dependency on relevant modules. I will do this in a followup CL",
